## Source documents (`data/raw/`)

The `data/raw/` directory contains source documents (Prince William County budgets, ACFRs, state reports, federal data) published by public agencies and authors. Those documents remain under their original licenses and copyright. This repository redistributes them under fair-use / public-record principles for analytical transparency. CC BY 4.0 applies to this repository's organization and indexing of those documents, not to the documents themselves.

## Suggested citation

Frantzen, M. (2026). *Prince William County Financial Analysis: Data, Models, and Extraction Pipelines*. https://github.com/mikefrantzen/PWCFinancialAnalysis
